The Icarus ability catalog was converted from Dart to JSON for Team Playbook
and compacted by storing per-map geometry overrides. See src/catalog.json.
The planar walls and compact elevation models under public/game were
generated from the Icarus 5.2.1 SVG height models. Door coordinates and
replay actor names were adapted from
lib/const/map_doors.dart in the same release.
The replay map registration, agent identifiers and ability catalog under
src/replay-*.json were adapted from the Icarus 5.2.1 replay tables.
The planar navigation data under src/navigation-data was generated from
the same release's map meshes and portal links.
QuickTime Animation layout in src/quicktime-animation.ts follows the same
release's QuickTime encoder and container writer.
